-# 🚀 RealtimeCollab
+# RealtimeCollab
 
-> A real-time collaborative Kanban workspace for managing projects, tasks, and team communication. Built with React, Spring Boot, and WebSocket—zero-latency updates for seamless team collaboration.
+A real-time Kanban workspace. Teams create workspaces and projects, move tasks across a board, comment on tasks, and see every change from teammates live over WebSocket.
 
-## 📋 Overview
+**Stack:** React 19 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind · Spring Boot 3.3 (Java 21) · PostgreSQL 16 · Flyway · STOMP over WebSocket · Docker Compose + nginx
 
-RealtimeCollab enables teams to collaborate on projects in real-time with:
+## Features
 
-- **User authentication** — Register, login, and manage secure sessions with JWT + refresh token rotation
-- **Workspaces** — Organize projects and invite teammates by email
-- **Kanban board** — Drag-and-drop tasks across columns (Backlog, In Progress, Done)
-- **Real-time sync** — Every change (task create/update/move/delete, comments) broadcasts to all viewers instantly via WebSocket
-- **Task management** — Create, assign, prioritize, and comment on tasks
-- **Team collaboration** — Invite members, control permissions (Owner/Member roles), and track activity
+- Register, log in, log out. JWT access tokens (15 min) and rotating refresh tokens (7 days, only a SHA-256 hash is stored).
+- Workspaces with `OWNER` / `MEMBER` roles. Owners invite existing users by email and remove members. Members can leave.
+- Projects per workspace (create, edit, archive) and tasks with status, priority, due date and assignee.
+- Drag-and-drop Kanban board with three columns: `BACKLOG`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `DONE`.
+- Task comments (add, list, delete your own).
+- Live updates: task created / updated / moved / deleted and comments are pushed to everyone viewing the board.
+- Every project, task and comment request checks workspace membership. WebSocket subscriptions are limited to the project boards the user can access.
 
