From c291b9515975992eba13e034da98afd13fa848b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:00:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Fix real bugs and complete the UI

Frontend bugs fixed:
- Tasks could not be edited at all: drawer is now a full editor (title, description, status, priority, due date, assignee)
- Dragging a card down inside a column put it in the wrong place; drop math rewritten and unit tested
- Other users' boards went out of order after a move (only the moved card was patched); now re-synced
- WebSocket reconnected with a stale token after 15 minutes; token is refreshed before every connect
- 'Live' badge was a hard-coded fake; now shows real Live / Reconnecting state
- Tasks created in a non-first column were created in TODO then moved (two requests); now created in place
- Body text defaulted to white on a light UI (text-white class on <body>)
- Comment delete button shown on other people's comments (always 403); only on your own
- Failed actions failed silently; errors now surface as toasts with the server's message
- Dead 'Forgot password?' button and unused AdminRoute/TopBar removed; 4 duplicate Avatar copies merged

Frontend features: search + priority + 'My tasks' filters, project rename/colour/archive/restore, shareable ?project= URL,
progress bar, mobile project picker, leave/delete workspace, keyboard drag-and-drop, 404 page, error boundary,
skeleton/error/retry states, favicon and page metadata. State moved to zustand; ESLint config added (was missing, npm run lint crashed).

Backend: create task with status, assignee must belong to the workspace, no new tasks in archived projects,
project restore endpoint, description length limits, TaskService tests.

CI: lint + 24 frontend tests.
